{
  "_doc": "The party comparison rule's case table (spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-06-party-model-design.md §4). Read by backend/src/common/comparable-parties.spec.ts and frontend/src/model/derive/__tests__/comparableParties.test.ts — both implementations must pass every case. Events model real ones (dates approximate where the test does not depend on them).",
  "events": [
